SystemLabel         ZrC64
NumberOfAtoms       64
NumberOfSpecies     2
LatticeConstant     4.6080847103 Ang
#NetCharge          -1
#SpinPolarized .true.

#LRWrite          .true.
PAO.EnergyShift   0.02 eV
MD.UseSaveXV .true.
 
MaxSCFIterations     100
DM.MixingWeight      0.1
DM.NumberPulay       4
DM.Tolerance         1.d-4
 
MeshCutoff         350. Ry
 
XC.functional        GGA
XC.authors           PBE
SolutionMethod       diagon
ElectronicTemperature 300. K
 
